<title>USA: Grossman's Inc Q3 net dropped.</title>
<headline>Grossman's Inc Q3 net dropped.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.05   profit	 $0.59</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,570   profit	15,230</p>
<p> Revs			95,972		  193,978</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  34,044		   26,031</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.11   profit	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net loss		  56,063   profit	 5,704</p>
<p> Revs		     296,657		  514,738</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  26,571		   25,949</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Revenues incloude sales from closed stores of nil vs $111.2 million in quarter and $48.0 million vs $290.8 million in nine months.</p>
<p>Net includes pretax store closing costs of nil vs $4.5 million in quarter and $40.1 million vs $4.5 million in nine months, and gains on property sales of $72,000 vs $18.1 million in quarter and $99,000 vs $18.3 million.</p>
<p>1995 net includes income tax of $1.7 million in quarter and $634,000 in nine months. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
